# cavekit-find-on-page.md R1-R5 (T-678): the app menu's Find on Page, a word typed by finger on the system keyboard and
# found from its first letter; Enter and Next forward, Prev back, round both ways, the engine's count each time; the
# match above the keyboard and clear of the bar; Done clears the match, puts the keyboard away and leaves the page there.
# jihad-find.html has "zebra" six times: five in the page (three cases, one on a dark band), the sixth in a frame after
# them, the order the engine's finder goes (the page, then its frames). `mark` before each chrome step: a chrome tap
# sets no mark, and an earlier "2 of 6" would answer a later wait.
id: find-steps
section: Find on page
item: Find on Page from the app menu (jihad-find.html): "zebra" typed is 1 of 6, Enter and Next go on, Prev goes back, before the first it goes round to 6 of 6 (the frame's) and past the last to 1 of 6, the bar saying so; the match stands above the keyboard; Done clears it, the keyboard goes and the page stays where the match put it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-find.html
kit: cavekit-find-on-page.md R1, R2, R3, R4, R5
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true
calibrate top
sample before-menu 0,30,300,180
chrome appmenu
wait differs 0,30,300,180 before-menu 5
wait still 0,30,300,180 3
mark
chrome appmenu-find
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys zebra
wait line 'find .5 bytes. -> 1' 10
wait line 'find-result: {"index":1,"total":6' 10
mark
chrome kb-enter
wait line 'find: 2 of 6' 8
expect above-keyboard p2
expect visible p2
mark
chrome find-next
wait line 'find: 3 of 6' 8
probe sel 'String(getSelection())'
expect probe-has ZEBRA
mark
chrome find-prev
wait line 'find: 2 of 6' 8
mark
chrome find-prev
wait line 'find: 1 of 6' 8
mark
chrome find-prev
wait line 'find: 6 of 6, went round' 8
shoot went-round-back
mark
chrome find-next
wait line 'find: 1 of 6, went round' 8
mark
chrome find-next
wait line 'find: 2 of 6' 8
mark
chrome find-done
wait line 'find: cleared' 8
expect keyboard down 8
probe sel 'String(getSelection()) + "|y=" + Math.round(scrollY) + "|"'
expect probe-lacks Zebra
expect probe-lacks |y=0|
shoot after-done
